      <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:21:37 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae22ef752d3f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ae22f1a4ae05.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;Replaces the look of the Dark set (Dark Hood / Tunic / Trousers) with a dark, Dark Link–style version of Linkle 3.0's Hero of Twilight outfit.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Features:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Hero of Twilight cap, tunic and trousers recolored black/grey&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- White hair under the cap&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Glowing red eyes (part of the cap, they follow the head)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Keeps the Dark set's stats and night speed bonus&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- The normal Hero of Twilight set is untouched — you can have both&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Requirements:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- The Linkle Mod 3.0&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Wii U / Cemu, installed with UKMM/BCML&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Installation (UKMM):&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Install the zip as a mod.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. Place it ABOVE The Linkle Mod 3.0 in the load order.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Apply and restart the game.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;---&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;RU: Тёмный набор превращается в тёмного Героя Сумерек для Linkle 3.0: чёрная броня, белые волосы, красные светящиеся глаза. Ставить через UKMM выше The Linkle Mod 3.0.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
