    <item>
      <title>Horrors of Hyrule</title>
      <author>Little Zelda guy</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/728496</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/728496#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">fac5855c7cf3ef20e48baec56246abf6dc4d4f1d</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 10:29:23 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad2940bcd479.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad2931629344.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad29316c2976.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad293179e68e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad29317c9fad.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad29317dfc0e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad293186f298.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad293191631f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ad29319711fe.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Small Updates and Bugfixes&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: Added a special interaction with the Circus Wheel Pumpkin when the player has no money&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: Burning corn now creates popcorn&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: Added progress counters to scavenger hunt quest logs&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: Added a map pin to the Dark Forest Scavenger Hunt quest&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: Added a black fade transition when warping to the Dark Forest&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Improvement&lt;/em&gt;: Big Pumpkin now asks players if they want to participate in more challenges instead of immediately ending the conversation&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Improvement&lt;/em&gt;: Added missing locations and quest givers to various quests&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Improvement&lt;/em&gt;: Increased quest priority so custom quests appear higher in the quest list&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Improvement&lt;/em&gt;: Standardized capitalization across all quest titles&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Improvement&lt;/em&gt;: Adjusted the teleport destination in Story Robert's scene so Link appears directly beside him and can immediately start a conversation&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Improvement&lt;/em&gt;: Improved camera positioning to properly show the wheel spinning&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Improvement&lt;/em&gt;: Repositioned golden statues in Kakariko to less conspicuous locations for better visual presentation&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Improvement&lt;/em&gt;: Made the wolf's sounds significantly louder and scarier&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Improvement&lt;/em&gt;: Updated popcorn item descriptions&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: Expanded area triggers so events activate slightly earlier&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: Adjusted the Pumpkin Golf camera to sit slightly off to the side for a better view&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: Adjusted the final battle music to be slightly louder than other tracks to increase tension and impact&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: Adjusted music volume levels to prevent excessively loud audio&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: Adjusted dialogue punctuation to better match Nintendo's writing style&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed Robert sometimes not spawning in his Kakariko house&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Big Pumpkin now announces that the quest is complete after all five scavenger hunts instead of asking players to participate again&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed an issue where saving and loading during the Pumpkin Golf quest could leave it stuck in an incompletable state&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Moved the Pumpkin Golf area outside the circus region to prevent unwanted fog effects&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed chests respawning when they should only appear once&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed the Mummy Sword respawning after being collected&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed the pumpkin prize pickup animation causing the prize to float in the air&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Added the silencing effect to Michael Myers' Pants as stated in their description&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: The Hallow Blade is now unbreakable as implied by its description&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed the music continuing to play after defeating the final enemies in the last battle&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Increased the height of the final area to prevent the environment from reverting to vanilla when jumping&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed the fireplace in Story Robert's scene floating in the air&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed candles having unintended collision&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Adjusted chest placement to prevent chests from appearing to float above the ground&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed the graveyard door not leading to the sky as intended&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed Bat Scavenger Hunt items occasionally appearing white instead of black&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed bats' eyes flashing yellow&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed the upper-floor fence of the house appearing black&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed a visual issue with the teleport plaque&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed incorrect textures on map items&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed the Scavenger Hunt: Abandoned Circus quest title not fitting properly in the quest log&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed Medal of Horror titles not fitting within their designated text areas&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed inconsistencies in item and character names across dialogue and descriptions&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed an instance of "..." appearing red in dialogue&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fixed various spelling and grammar mistakes&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;IMPORTANT DISCLAIMER: &lt;/b&gt;This mod is NOT compatible with UKMM because of a UKMM bug reported &lt;a href="https://github.com/NiceneNerd/UKMM/issues/349"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. Please use BCML instead.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod is a Halloween Expansion DLC for Breath of the Wild.&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
It adds a main quest, side quests, new enemies, armor sets, weapons and minigames, spread over six new places around Hyrule.&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
You even get post-game content after the new main quest!&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
Oh, and make sure that before you start this, you make plenty of room in your Armor Set inventory because you'll need it!&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;b&gt;The Main Quest&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
After you find Robert in Kakariko, in his fully Halloween-themed house, he tells you about the horrors spread out in Hyrule. To help you on your quest he gives you a never-before-seen item in BotW: a Flashlight!&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
Discover these new areas, built from the ground up:&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;a Graveyard&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;an Abandoned Circus&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;a Corn Maze&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;a Haunted House&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;a Dark Forest&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
In each of these places you find a new enemy that you have to defeat to complete your quest!&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
Watch out for the post-game content too for a super special armor set!&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;b&gt;Side content&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Every new Area has an Armor Set or an Armor Piece scattered near a villain from a Horror Movie&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Scavenger Hunt: each new Area also has 5 collectibles - bring every collectible to the Big Pumpkin in Robert's House and he'll give you a special prize!&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;The circus has three minigames and one of them with a never-before-seen mechanic in BotW&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;Ask Robert for a story and he'll take you to a campfire and tell you about any of the five places.&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;li&gt;You even get new Halloween tips on the loading screens!&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;b&gt;Enemies&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
Besides the five main creatures, you'll run into Ghostface, Michael Myers and many other classic Horror Movie villains!&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;b&gt;Armor and weapons&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
There are many, many full armor sets scattered around the world... Can you find the Black Plague doctor's set though? It's super hidden in an unexpected place!&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;br&gt;&#13;
