    <item>
      <title>Fast Main Quests</title>
      <author>Fenris_3202</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/721695</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/721695#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">054cdadaf2fc4a978338b42347c3e90443f64023</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 21:17:21 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac81ec6af20d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6acc264e59646.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6acc265387915.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6acc265419f16.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6acc264f6c0e1.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6acc265302fd4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6acc26529f439.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6acc26527271f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6acc2652c8ec2.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6acc48c66af33.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6acc47df2362c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6acc265288e31.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mod:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod edits the vast majority of main quests via shorter dialogue, skippable events, and changes to events. It also includes edits to Trial Of The Sword, because I can.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod generally doesn't allow the player to skip content, but simply speeds up the process of getting through quests. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Quest Edits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/ns6QEtdsKvo?si=VYvW_W_ijcB-DTyl" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Intro/Follow The Sheikah Slate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shrine of Resurrection pedestals skippable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No animations for first scope and map open&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Zelda's Interruption outside SOR is shorter&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Old Man lets you take his stuff&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tower activation skippable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tower drip animation removed (for all towers)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/ns6QEtdsKvo?si=zjQvtBb8HGZweycg&amp;t=278" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Isolated Plateau&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/ns6QEtdsKvo?si=zjQvtBb8HGZweycg&amp;t=278" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter Old Man dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No drip animation for runes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No extra campfire dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No first guardian "cutscene"&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No "up here" dialogue in Temple of Time&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/HPYm11zG_3A?si=goWLSW6uwom6pOEI" target="_blank"&gt;Seek Out Impa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Guards don't interrupt&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Paya doesn't interrupt&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;"Cutscene" of Link entering skippable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No Impa re-talk&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/HPYm11zG_3A?si=BihrG1RMQyuRtKDV&amp;t=49" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Locked Mementos&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Purah won't lie&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Torch placed next to blue flame&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter Purah dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No drip animation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/HPYm11zG_3A?si=kNiSPIMSR8nvt-h2&amp;t=209" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Captured Memories&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;"Cutscene" of Link remembering skippable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Impa's final memory dialogue skippable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;If final memory recall is skipped, Zelda's dialogue is skipped&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/PKHTk51cc-g?si=9unKdUQ2PEp5OptL"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Free The Divine Beasts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;No dialogue from Zelda if Link hasn't received the quest&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Link remembering skippable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Skippable warp location activation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No drip animation for maps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Terminals left is shown via text from the terminal&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No Zelda dialogue when all beasts are finished&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter final Impa dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/WEFIz4VWgno?si=D24q7J6VxTNwRJFk" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reach Zora's Domain&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Interruption from Zora in wetlands is removed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter Sidon dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Sidon Interruptions before moblin attack removed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/WEFIz4VWgno?si=zcA6Ep-bZuJlIyZm&amp;t=364" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Divine Beast Vah Ruta&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter Dorephan dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;First half of Dorephan dialogue skippable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;First half of Muzu dialogue skippable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter Muzu dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Old Zora by shock arrow is moved away&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/xJvsTACkC48?si=3OSf5Eak4D72U-87" target="_blank"&gt;Divine Beast Vah Rudania&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter Bludo dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Memory is shifted to first Bludo talk&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No Bludo re-talk&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Camera animation from freeing Yunobo removed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter Yunobo dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No camera shift at Bridge of Eldin trouble&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter Bridge of Eldin fall&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rudania fight start and damage "cutscenes" are skippable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Yunobo hears whistle and follows from twice as far&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Yunobo talk after Rudania removed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/kIpxmHU1hPY?si=IM8yMF05FcMm9nlr" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Divine Beast Vah Medoh&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter Kaneli dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter Teba dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter Great Eagle Bow dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/bsfcCk4jFek?si=9hBNC8rvUtjuLxlF" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Forbidden City Entry&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Vai clothes merchant available after viewing Naboris in Oasis&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter dialogue from quest giver&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Don't need to talk to quest giver&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter merchant dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No vai clothes "cutscene"(opt)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/bsfcCk4jFek?si=M8e5pPy2JayFIlOx&amp;t=80" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Divine Beast Vah Naboris&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;First Riju/Buliara dialogue can be skipped&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Teake dialogue shorter&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Master Khoga appear/defeat can be skipped&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter Riju dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Prayer "cutscene" skippable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/HPRuO52ggb0?si=eFQIY56GkdaS5QIA" target="_blank"&gt;The Hero's Sword&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/2aaKs8V_S0o?si=fU3THOnJgLh5qyG2" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;No zoom in on sword&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter Deku Tree dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter Impa dialogue for collecting sword&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/HPRuO52ggb0?si=Nwf5GqGl5TEWB_cI&amp;t=100" target="_blank"&gt;EX Trial Of The Sword&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/2aaKs8V_S0o?si=cTyLX02MhMesbkX4&amp;t=100" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter dialogue for getting quest&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Skippable Deku Tree info dump&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Skippable monk dialogue at the end&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/fON7kk9dHJc?si=B6GC-daDbMg-t-eq" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;EX The Champion's Ballad&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter first pedestal&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dialogue after losing life skippable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dialogue after final shrine skippable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Medallion shrine location reveal shortened&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Kass songs skippable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter get emblem dialogue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter dialogue to enter re-fight&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter champion talk after memory&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shorter call to Shrine of Resurrection&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Maz Koshia dialogue skippable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No drip animation for Master Cycle&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Master Cycle appear and download can be skipped(opt)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Final Kass dialogue skippable&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;Note:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;I have done my best to make this mod fully compatible with a mid game save, but you still install it at your own risk. If you're really paranoid, install before starting or after finishing Rudania.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod heavily affects eventflows and dialogue, and will be incompatible with mods that edit the same  NPCs and eventflows. If you have multiple event-based mods, place this at a higher priority to ensure proper functionality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
